<title>MEXICO: Telmex to release Q2 results later today.</title>
<headline>Telmex to release Q2 results later today.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonos de Mexico SA de CV (Telmex) is due to post its second quarter earnings later today, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The company did not give a release time for its earnings, but it sent an invitation to analysts to attend an &quot;information session relating to financial earnings for the second quarter&quot; beginning at 1730 local time/1830 EDT/2230 GMT.</p>
<p>(( -- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
</text>
